# The peer closes first: its FIN is ACKed, the application closes, and the
# ACK of the stack's FIN takes LAST_ACK to CLOSED.
0      listen 8080
+0     < S 0:0(0) win 65535 <mss 1460>
+0     > S. 0:0(0) ack 1 <mss 1460>
+0.010 < . 1:1(0) ack 1 win 65535
+0     accept

+0     < F. 1:1(0) ack 1 win 65535
+0     > . 1:1(0) ack 2
+0     state CLOSE_WAIT
+0.100 close
+0     > F. 1:1(0) ack 2
+0     state LAST_ACK
+0.010 < . 2:2(0) ack 2 win 65535
+0     state CLOSED
